# The four files a redeploy has to actually reach.
#
# The service worker serves the copy it has. If the CDN also serves the copy it
# has, an installed phone can sit on a build for as long as its edge cache
# lives, and nothing about the device suggests it is looking at an old one.
# must-revalidate means the browser asks every time and gets 304 when nothing
# moved, which costs one small request and makes a deploy arrive.
#
# Everything else in this folder is cache first on purpose: the icons, the
# vendored React and the vendored three.js are files whose contents do not
# change without the release they belong to changing.
#
# index.html is the cover and app.html is the app. Both are pages a redeploy
# has to reach, so both are listed: a must-revalidate cover in front of a
# stale app is a fresh door onto an old room.

# Security headers, on every response. Added 11 October 2026.
#
# Content-Security-Policy is the second wall behind React's escaping: if script
# ever did get into a page, connect-src and img-src leave it nowhere to send a
# birth record or a session token except this site, the project's own
# Supabase, and the place search. The runtime compiles templates with new
# Function and the pages carry inline scripts and styles, so 'unsafe-eval' and
# 'unsafe-inline' stay until that changes; the policy earns its keep on where
# data may go and who may frame the page, not on which scripts may run.
# frame-ancestors 'self' stops another site framing the sign in form to steal
# clicks, and still lets the verification harness frame the app from this
# origin. Anything new the app has to reach is added to connect-src here, or it
# is refused in the browser with a console error naming this policy.
# challenges.cloudflare.com is Cloudflare Turnstile, the sign in page's check
# against automated sign ups: its script (script-src) and the frame it draws
# its challenge in (frame-src). The cover loads it only once the form is used.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' 'unsafe-eval' blob: https://challenges.cloudflare.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; font-src 'self' data: https://fonts.gstatic.com; img-src 'self' data: blob:; media-src 'self' data: blob:; connect-src 'self' https://lkzcybzhjjxdqetwwdrx.supabase.co wss://lkzcybzhjjxdqetwwdrx.supabase.co https://nominatim.openstreetmap.org; worker-src 'self' blob:; manifest-src 'self'; frame-src 'self' https://challenges.cloudflare.com; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'self'
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin

/index.html
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
/app.html
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
/sw.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
/manifest.json
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
